      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Oh! ¡Si traes a Pansage, Pansear y Panpour\ncontigo! ¡Estupendo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004F00680021002000A10053006900200074007200610065007300200061002000500061006E0073006100670065002C002000500061006E007300650061007200200079002000500061006E0070006F00750072000A0063006F006E007400690067006F0021002000A1004500730074007500700065006E0064006F002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Muchísimas gracias! Me pondré manos a la obra.\nPuedes esperar aquí.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D00750063006800ED00730069006D006100730020006700720061006300690061007300210020004D006500200070006F006E0064007200E90020006D0061006E006F0073002000610020006C00610020006F006200720061002E000A00500075006500640065007300200065007300700065007200610072002000610071007500ED002E00100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gracias por la espera!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004700720061006300690061007300200070006F00720020006C00610020006500730070006500720061002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡He aquí el té Pansage-Pansear-Panpour o,\ncomo yo lo llamo, el \"té monetes\"!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEl otro nombre es demasiado largo y se me traba\nla lengua.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y ahora tú tendrás el placer de ser nuestr<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa\nprimer<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa client<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāea en degustarlo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué te ha parecido? ¿A que tanto el sabor como\nel aroma y sus propiedades revitalizantes son<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ninigualables?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 115
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ah, por cierto! ¡Que no se me olvide devolverte\ntus Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100410068002C00200070006F0072002000630069006500720074006F0021002000A10051007500650020006E006F0020007300650020006D00650020006F006C00760069006400650020006400650076006F006C00760065007200740065000A00740075007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002100100002011401340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
